1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:02:01,540
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:04,370 --> 00:02:07,960
No animals were hurt during the filming
of this series.

3
00:02:15,930 --> 00:02:18,350
I hope my child borns in good health
so that...

4
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:20,800
...I can see him wearing these.

5
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,440
I hope, Bala Hatun.

6
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:23,480
I hope.

7
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,560
Give it to me.

8
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:48,260
Are you all right, Bala Hatun?

9
00:02:48,260 --> 00:02:49,530
I am fine, Zehra.

10
00:02:49,530 --> 00:02:51,310
It is kicking often these days.

11
00:02:51,490 --> 00:02:52,680
It will go away now.

12
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,710
There is more time.

13
00:03:01,070 --> 00:03:01,980
Bala Hatun!

14
00:03:02,450 --> 00:03:04,370
Zehra, my baby is coming!

15
00:03:04,370 --> 00:03:05,750
Lay down a little bit!

16
00:03:05,750 --> 00:03:08,060
Zehra, my baby is coming!

17
00:03:08,060 --> 00:03:10,030
Mother told me there was time!

18
00:03:10,030 --> 00:03:12,000
Go tell her! Run!

19
00:03:18,170 --> 00:03:18,990
My child!

20
00:03:19,310 --> 00:03:20,960
Aren't you ashamed at all?

21
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,520
Why are you torturing the children?

22
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:26,360
But Selcen Mother, they didn't complete
their jobs, twice.

23
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:30,600
I see how they work and how you work
either.

24
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:35,040
This was the last!

25
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:36,980
What do you want from these girls?

26
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:41,150
Why are you breaking their hearts
instead of mothering them?

27
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:42,840
What about you?

28
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,960
Kayı's hatuns!

29
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,960
Why aren't you protecting these girls?

30
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:51,360
Who keeps silent against oppression is
as bad as the one who oppresses.

31
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:53,140
Does this suit you?

32
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:57,640
Selcen Mother, Bala Hatun!

33
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,940
What happened to Bala?

34
00:03:58,940 --> 00:04:01,580
Her water broke down, Selcen Mother!
The baby is coming!

35
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,970
Come on, hatuns!
Come on!

36
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,990
Cloth and hot water!
Come on!

37
00:04:05,990 --> 00:04:07,590
My Osman's child is coming!

38
00:04:07,660 --> 00:04:08,910
Let's go!

39
00:04:13,510 --> 00:04:16,950
How fast you grew up, right?

40
00:04:17,730 --> 00:04:20,240
Oh, my Orhan!

41
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:23,320
I both want to see you become a valiant...

42
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:25,880
...and wonder how you will be when you
grow up.

43
00:04:26,270 --> 00:04:29,860
But I also want you to never grew up and
be in my arms forever.

44
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:35,600
But don't listen to me, my Orhan.

45
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:38,400
You surely will grow up, my valiant son!

46
00:04:39,310 --> 00:04:41,840
The foal grows, the horse rests...

47
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:44,440
...the son grows, the father rests.

48
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,340
My heart!

49
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:51,680
Can I come in, Malhun?

50
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:53,840
Come in, Aygül!

51
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:01,580
What is it, Aygül?

52
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:05,060
It's good news.

53
00:05:05,060 --> 00:05:05,920
Bala...

54
00:05:07,420 --> 00:05:09,260
...the birth started.

55
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:11,480
Our Orhan will have a sibling!

56
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:13,450
What are you saying, Aygül?

57
00:05:14,930 --> 00:05:18,050
Selcen Mother said there was more time.

58
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,870
What if it is just a cramp?

59
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,780
We were surprised too but...

60
00:05:22,190 --> 00:05:25,150
...her water broke down.
My mother is with her, don't worry.

61
00:05:26,810 --> 00:05:28,530
May it come with blessings.

62
00:05:28,530 --> 00:05:29,570
I hope.

63
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:32,580
May my Orhan's sibling be
born in good health.

64
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:34,640
I hope. I hope.

65
00:05:35,630 --> 00:05:37,260
Come on, let's go!

66
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:39,460
Inform Ayşe Hatun too.

67
00:05:39,660 --> 00:05:40,960
I will.

68
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,580
Come on.

69
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,760
My Orhan...

70
00:05:50,450 --> 00:05:54,360
...let's see if your sibling is a girl
or a boy.

71
00:05:59,300 --> 00:06:00,860
My child!

72
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:03,280
-My girl!
-Mother!

73
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:04,740
Mother, my baby is coming!

74
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:06,540
-Thankfully!
-My baby is coming!

75
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:08,120
Our child is coming!

76
00:06:08,350 --> 00:06:10,300
Zehra, put a pillow behind her!

77
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:11,560
Come on!

78
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:12,890
Come on!

79
00:06:15,660 --> 00:06:17,180
Thank you, my Allah!

80
00:06:18,730 --> 00:06:20,980
Come here. Let's open this.

81
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:25,520
Tell me, does your pain come often?

82
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,990
Yes, mother!
It hurts terribly, mother!

83
00:06:28,180 --> 00:06:29,360
It will pass, my girl.

84
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:32,260
When you hold your child in your
arms, all your pain will end.

85
00:06:32,260 --> 00:06:34,660
I hope!
I hope!

86
00:06:34,830 --> 00:06:37,100
Mother, what is the situation?

87
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:39,040
Her pain comes and goes.

88
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,760
I hope it will come in health.

89
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:41,910
Come on, Bala!

90
00:06:41,910 --> 00:06:43,300
Hang in there!

91
00:06:49,460 --> 00:06:50,570
Zehra, come on!

92
00:06:51,370 --> 00:06:52,690
Hot water, clothes!

93
00:06:52,690 --> 00:06:54,050
Come on!
Come on!

94
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:56,840
Hang on, Bala!
Hang on!

95
00:07:15,910 --> 00:07:17,230
Take this, brother!

96
00:07:53,380 --> 00:07:55,250
-My Bey!
-Osman Bey!

97
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,010
My Bey!

98
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,820
My Bey! My Bey!

99
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:08,710
We came here for Geyhatu!

100
00:08:08,870 --> 00:08:10,640
Save your rage for him, Osman Bey!

101
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:18,070
Come on!
Come on!

102
00:08:22,790 --> 00:08:25,160
Hang on, brother!

103
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,170
I am.

104
00:08:36,058 --> 00:08:37,179
Alps!

105
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:39,700
Hold the Vizier!

106
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:42,419
I am going after Geyhatu.

107
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:44,560
Come on!

108
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:19,300
Konur...

109
00:09:19,860 --> 00:09:21,650
...go after Osman.

110
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:25,340
Bring him to me.
Alive or dead.

111
00:09:25,490 --> 00:09:26,200
Come on!

112
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,800
As you order!

113
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,480
Argus! Argus!

114
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:48,660
I can't let my soldiers die for nothing
in a hell like this!

115
00:09:48,810 --> 00:09:50,240
Retreat!

116
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:52,090
-Do you hear me?
-Yes, Sir!

117
00:09:52,090 --> 00:09:53,380
Soldier!

118
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:54,890
Retreat!

119
00:10:01,500 --> 00:10:03,450
You came in time, Erbey.

120
00:10:03,450 --> 00:10:06,580
I came a long way to here from Konya,
my Vizier.

121
00:10:07,070 --> 00:10:08,450
What is my duty?

122
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:12,080
Konur.

123
00:10:14,290 --> 00:10:15,600
Konur?

124
00:10:16,830 --> 00:10:20,750
I believe he did the worst wrong, Erbey.

125
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:24,550
I think he offered his loyalty to Osman...

126
00:10:24,820 --> 00:10:27,200
...and not the State.

127
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:30,300
Go after him, at once.

128
00:10:30,930 --> 00:10:33,080
Konur has been my brother for a long
time.

129
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:35,480
But there is a price for betrayal!

130
00:10:36,500 --> 00:10:40,720
The moment I see him do something
wrong I will bring you his head.

131
00:10:47,770 --> 00:10:50,480
Attack!
Capture them all!

132
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,330
Come on!

133
00:11:13,070 --> 00:11:14,560
Geyhatu!

134
00:11:24,850 --> 00:11:27,810
I am angry like a wolf running after
its prey!

135
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:30,300
Geyhatu!

136
00:11:31,610 --> 00:11:33,880
You have nowhere to go!

137
00:11:35,190 --> 00:11:36,410
Come on!

138
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,510
Commander Geyhatu!

139
00:12:11,780 --> 00:12:15,010
Thank God we could leave.

140
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:21,350
I will live because I will kill!

141
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:25,280
You are bleeding, Commander Geyhatu!

142
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:30,080
I will bandage your wound.
The guards will catch up.

143
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,560
Take it out.

144
00:13:18,990 --> 00:13:21,100
Cerkutay!
Brother!

145
00:13:32,580 --> 00:13:36,720
Your Osman Bey turned his back and left.

146
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:42,940
He left you to my mercy.

147
00:14:22,590 --> 00:14:25,240
Prepare the logs.
Come on!

148
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:31,070
Your cruelty...

149
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:36,040
...is looming, Vizier Alemşah!

150
00:14:45,030 --> 00:14:47,280
You could at least let out wounded
brother go!

151
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:55,410
Vizier!

152
00:15:06,810 --> 00:15:08,410
No need.

153
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:12,460
You will die sooner or later.

154
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:23,960
When Osman finds out that I have you...

155
00:15:24,910 --> 00:15:27,850
...then it will be your end.

156
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:43,930
Take these rebel men.

157
00:15:44,630 --> 00:15:50,190
Threw them where they deserve
as they deserve.

158
00:15:51,330 --> 00:15:52,090
Come on!

159
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:18,030
Cerkutay!

160
00:16:19,270 --> 00:16:20,850
Slow down!

161
00:17:13,030 --> 00:17:14,240
He is near.

162
00:17:14,970 --> 00:17:17,530
He is near, Turgut Bey.

163
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:19,630
Come on!

164
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:40,220
Geyhatu!

165
00:17:42,370 --> 00:17:43,440
Stop!

166
00:17:44,180 --> 00:17:48,570
Let us finish our unfinished business!

167
00:17:59,650 --> 00:18:00,520
Osman!

168
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:11,340
If it was easy to kill me...

169
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:14,430
...I wouldn't live this long, Osman!

170
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:45,330
Let's go, Commander Geyhatu.

171
00:19:04,540 --> 00:19:06,720
Mother! I can't take it anymore!

172
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:09,310
Be patient, my girl.
It will be fine.

173
00:19:14,550 --> 00:19:17,050
You are a strong hatun.
You can handle this.

174
00:19:17,050 --> 00:19:18,240
Come on!

175
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,950
Hang on! Hang on!

176
00:19:25,970 --> 00:19:26,770
Hang on!

177
00:19:35,060 --> 00:19:35,850
Come on.

178
00:19:51,770 --> 00:19:52,680
It will be hard.

179
00:19:53,110 --> 00:19:54,490
Too hard.

180
00:19:54,740 --> 00:19:55,540
Don't say!

181
00:19:57,260 --> 00:19:58,700
She needs strength.

182
00:19:58,900 --> 00:20:00,020
Go to the healing room.

183
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:02,690
Tell the midwife to prepare sherbet.

184
00:20:02,690 --> 00:20:03,830
She knows what to do.

185
00:20:03,830 --> 00:20:05,560
Come on, my girl.

186
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:06,660
I am taking care of it.

187
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:08,610
Mother!

188
00:20:11,120 --> 00:20:12,930
If I could wait a little more...

189
00:20:12,930 --> 00:20:14,930
...my Osman would be here too.

190
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:17,420
My Osman will come.

191
00:20:17,420 --> 00:20:20,460
You will hold your child together, I hope.

192
00:20:21,270 --> 00:20:23,010
He will.

193
00:20:25,010 --> 00:20:27,150
Our baby will be born safely.

194
00:20:27,190 --> 00:20:28,460
Right, mother?

195
00:20:28,690 --> 00:20:30,280
Of course, my girl!

196
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:32,220
It wants to come to you.

197
00:20:32,220 --> 00:20:33,320
So it will.

198
00:20:37,060 --> 00:20:40,310
But obviously, it will be stubborn like
its father.

199
00:21:11,450 --> 00:21:12,533
My Bey!

200
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:44,100
Brothers, come on!

201
00:21:56,030 --> 00:21:58,210
Cerkutay!
Brother!

202
00:21:58,500 --> 00:22:01,050
Hang on, my brother!
Hang on!

203
00:22:02,740 --> 00:22:04,110
Hang on, brother!

204
00:22:11,330 --> 00:22:13,160
Tunahan, hold it tight!

205
00:22:13,350 --> 00:22:14,430
He can't carry heavy.

206
00:22:17,260 --> 00:22:19,340
Hang on, my brother!

207
00:22:22,660 --> 00:22:25,660
Come on, brothers!
Carry on!

208
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,960
You are good!

209
00:22:52,810 --> 00:22:54,020
Let me go!

210
00:22:58,390 --> 00:22:59,990
Brother!
Cerkutay!

211
00:23:00,510 --> 00:23:01,390
Cerkutay!

212
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:04,230
Hang on! Hang on!

213
00:23:04,650 --> 00:23:06,640
Brother!
My brother!

214
00:23:08,030 --> 00:23:10,350
-Cerkutay!
-Hang on, brother!

215
00:23:24,940 --> 00:23:25,860
Come on!

216
00:23:28,540 --> 00:23:30,040
Calm down!

217
00:23:31,850 --> 00:23:34,810
Vizier, at least let my brother go!

218
00:23:35,730 --> 00:23:37,650
All of you deserve the same!

219
00:23:38,450 --> 00:23:41,440
First the pit, then the hell!

220
00:23:42,470 --> 00:23:43,890
Stop!

221
00:23:44,750 --> 00:23:46,380
Have you no mercy?

222
00:23:46,380 --> 00:23:48,030
I will carry my brother!
Let go!

223
00:23:48,460 --> 00:23:49,390
Come here, brother.

224
00:23:50,870 --> 00:23:51,700
Come here.

225
00:23:51,700 --> 00:23:53,190
Hang on, Cerkutay.

226
00:23:53,190 --> 00:23:54,150
Come here, brother.

227
00:23:56,190 --> 00:23:58,150
Don't push!
Have you no mercy?

228
00:24:00,980 --> 00:24:02,570
Come on!
Come on!

229
00:24:02,910 --> 00:24:04,130
Brothers!

230
00:24:04,770 --> 00:24:06,180
Take Cerkutay!

231
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:09,340
Come here, brother.

232
00:24:11,410 --> 00:24:12,700
Come on!

233
00:24:23,070 --> 00:24:25,040
You will be fine, Cerkutay!

234
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:45,240
Konya saved the ones who...

235
00:24:46,055 --> 00:24:50,815
...disobeyed the Vizier of Konya.

236
00:24:53,622 --> 00:24:55,902
But now, there's no one to save them.

237
00:24:57,430 --> 00:24:59,770
They are rebellious dogs!

238
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:04,890
Give the dogs raw meat and dirty water!

239
00:25:06,020 --> 00:25:09,090
Bring the soldiers in Söğüt to Kayı
Tribe.

240
00:25:09,510 --> 00:25:12,460
From now on, no one who loves
Osman...

241
00:25:12,900 --> 00:25:15,740
...will be free.

242
00:25:17,280 --> 00:25:21,390
Neither his mom, his hatuns or his child!

243
00:25:21,630 --> 00:25:22,680
Clear!

244
00:25:23,220 --> 00:25:24,970
As you order, my Vizier.

245
00:25:25,270 --> 00:25:26,930
Alemşah!

246
00:25:27,370 --> 00:25:31,660
Don't you dare touch the tribe!

247
00:25:32,230 --> 00:25:34,320
Don't you dare touch the hatuns!

248
00:25:34,550 --> 00:25:36,630
Stay away from our tribe!

249
00:25:38,360 --> 00:25:39,100
Deh!

250
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,290
Delikız!

251
00:27:05,350 --> 00:27:06,180
Brother!

252
00:27:08,040 --> 00:27:09,790
Thank you, Osman Bey.

253
00:27:10,310 --> 00:27:11,790
Thank you, brothers!

254
00:27:13,790 --> 00:27:14,760
Geyhatu...

255
00:27:16,300 --> 00:27:18,480
...clearly filled the road with traps.

256
00:27:19,510 --> 00:27:21,190
But he can't stop us.

257
00:27:22,220 --> 00:27:25,340
Now, we will be careful too.

258
00:27:26,620 --> 00:27:28,290
Now we are sure, Osman Bey.

259
00:27:29,420 --> 00:27:31,290
...since we face these traps...

260
00:27:32,660 --> 00:27:34,170
...we are on the right way.

261
00:27:35,300 --> 00:27:36,040
Come on.

262
00:27:49,830 --> 00:27:51,570
Give me your hand!

263
00:28:01,840 --> 00:28:02,560
Mother.

264
00:28:03,330 --> 00:28:04,800
My pain is gone.

265
00:28:05,360 --> 00:28:06,360
My baby?

266
00:28:14,510 --> 00:28:15,650
Don't worry now.

267
00:28:15,650 --> 00:28:17,650
It comes and goes.

268
00:28:18,970 --> 00:28:20,840
Look, here is your baby.

269
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:24,330
Tell me when it moves.

270
00:28:24,990 --> 00:28:25,690
All right.

271
00:28:48,300 --> 00:28:51,410
Her water broke down early.
There was time.

272
00:28:54,650 --> 00:28:56,430
Mother says the baby is there.

273
00:28:57,410 --> 00:28:59,450
It doesn't seem to be easy, Malhun Hatun.

274
00:29:01,600 --> 00:29:05,140
May my Allah give her strength,
make it easier.

275
00:29:05,670 --> 00:29:06,580
I hope.

276
00:29:06,940 --> 00:29:09,260
Don't let Bala Hatun hear.
She will be scared.

277
00:29:09,900 --> 00:29:10,910
You are right.

278
00:29:19,620 --> 00:29:21,040
Nothing will happen, right?

279
00:29:21,040 --> 00:29:23,340
No, my girl. You just pray.

280
00:29:23,340 --> 00:29:24,940
Take deep breaths.
Come on.

281
00:29:25,080 --> 00:29:26,500
Think of the good, all right?

282
00:29:32,820 --> 00:29:34,340
Her water broke down but...

283
00:29:42,290 --> 00:29:44,260
Mother?
Mother?

284
00:29:44,530 --> 00:29:45,970
Is my baby fine?

285
00:29:46,930 --> 00:29:48,400
It is fine, my girl.

286
00:29:48,700 --> 00:29:49,720
Zehra!

287
00:29:57,330 --> 00:29:59,940
Calm down, Bala.
Calm down.

288
00:30:05,570 --> 00:30:08,400
Let's make her move a bit, right?

289
00:30:08,990 --> 00:30:10,430
Sure, mother.
Come on!

290
00:30:10,430 --> 00:30:13,310
Come on, my Bala. Hold onto me.

291
00:30:13,310 --> 00:30:14,220
Wait.

292
00:30:15,330 --> 00:30:16,360
Hold on to me, Bala.

293
00:30:21,960 --> 00:30:23,240
What is this?

294
00:30:34,210 --> 00:30:36,610
Oh, my Allah!
May you protect us!

295
00:30:44,120 --> 00:30:46,380
Ayşe, Malhun go check outside.

296
00:30:46,380 --> 00:30:47,140
Come on.

297
00:30:52,080 --> 00:30:52,960
Mother...

298
00:30:53,510 --> 00:30:55,250
...can it be Osman?

299
00:30:55,520 --> 00:30:57,380
We will see, my girl.

300
00:31:09,560 --> 00:31:11,560
What is going on here, Vizier Alemşah?

301
00:31:12,760 --> 00:31:19,000
Aren't you going to welcome the Vizier of
Konya, Malhun Hatun?

302
00:31:51,840 --> 00:31:54,220
Why are you drawing your swords
at my alps, Vizier?

303
00:31:54,500 --> 00:31:56,240
What do you want from us?

304
00:31:59,580 --> 00:32:02,700
Your alps are rebels like you.

305
00:32:03,170 --> 00:32:06,790
They don't listen to
the Vizier of the State of Seljuk.

306
00:32:07,920 --> 00:32:10,580
But today, I didn't come for them.

307
00:32:11,080 --> 00:32:13,100
I came for you.

308
00:32:15,930 --> 00:32:20,460
I arrest you, Bala Hatun and
Selcen Hatun...

309
00:32:21,180 --> 00:32:30,620
...for helping Osman, who rebelled againts
the Seljuk State!

310
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:36,780
Let our hatuns go!
You can't take them!

311
00:32:43,520 --> 00:32:45,780
What are you saying, Alemşah?

312
00:32:45,960 --> 00:32:47,760
What is this?

313
00:32:49,820 --> 00:32:50,940
Back off!

314
00:32:53,530 --> 00:32:55,290
There is a birth happening inside.

315
00:32:55,290 --> 00:32:57,990
Let my mother and Bala go.
I will come with you.

316
00:32:59,340 --> 00:33:04,100
I no longer believe your games,
Malhun Hatun!

317
00:33:05,050 --> 00:33:06,790
Get out of my way!

318
00:33:11,330 --> 00:33:12,550
Let me go!

319
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:18,080
Go away! Let our hatuns go!
Leave, you dogs!

320
00:33:24,910 --> 00:33:26,230
Aygül!

321
00:33:30,110 --> 00:33:33,170
I am so sorry.
Deeply sorry.

322
00:33:33,190 --> 00:33:34,350
Rogatus...

323
00:33:34,510 --> 00:33:35,750
...died.

324
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:42,000
When Vizier attacked him with
his soldiers...

325
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:45,320
...it got even worse.

326
00:33:46,170 --> 00:33:48,730
No one could get out of there.

327
00:33:48,850 --> 00:33:50,230
As you will understand...

328
00:33:50,670 --> 00:33:55,350
...I made a move and retreated to save
my soldiers.

329
00:33:56,430 --> 00:34:00,790
You left him alone on the battlefield!

330
00:34:02,940 --> 00:34:06,180
We couldn't even see who hit who!,

331
00:34:12,100 --> 00:34:15,438
You left your brother alone
on the battlefield!

332
00:34:15,438 --> 00:34:16,438
What could I do?

333
00:34:16,438 --> 00:34:19,320
Should I have let my soldiers die?

334
00:34:25,139 --> 00:34:27,460
You broke your promise, Nikola!

335
00:34:27,460 --> 00:34:30,540
I made this alliance to protect my family
and my soldiers!

336
00:34:30,540 --> 00:34:32,540
Not to die for nothing!

337
00:34:35,899 --> 00:34:37,360
Also...

338
00:34:38,500 --> 00:34:39,659
...Gündüz Bey...

339
00:34:40,460 --> 00:34:47,039
...didn't you turn your back on your
brother for the same reason?

340
00:34:58,050 --> 00:34:59,250
Gündüz Bey!

341
00:35:10,110 --> 00:35:13,470
Vizier and Geyhatu know you are with us.

342
00:35:15,340 --> 00:35:16,900
There is no turning back now.

343
00:35:18,690 --> 00:35:20,910
Don't ever make a mistake.

344
00:35:22,650 --> 00:35:24,970
Then my sword won't hit your sword.

345
00:35:25,640 --> 00:35:27,480
It will hit your neck, Nikola!

346
00:35:28,210 --> 00:35:29,530
Your neck!

347
00:35:42,740 --> 00:35:44,680
Don't worry, Nikola.

348
00:35:46,560 --> 00:35:48,400
I am saving you for myself.

349
00:36:00,090 --> 00:36:02,390
Kosses...

350
00:36:02,390 --> 00:36:05,370
...you are saving me for yourself, huh?

351
00:36:06,940 --> 00:36:08,280
Argus!

352
00:36:10,420 --> 00:36:12,200
I am Aya Nikola.

353
00:36:13,300 --> 00:36:17,880
I'm never on the losing side.

354
00:36:20,980 --> 00:36:25,480
Send the Vizier a messenger to tell him I
want to make up with him.

355
00:36:25,590 --> 00:36:26,870
As you order, Sir.

356
00:36:29,560 --> 00:36:33,420
I have crucially important things to tell
him.

357
00:36:42,020 --> 00:36:43,380
Gündüz Bey!

358
00:36:47,860 --> 00:36:49,680
I told Turgut too, that I know...

359
00:36:52,070 --> 00:36:54,870
...when he will betray us.

360
00:36:55,390 --> 00:36:57,330
He will, because he is afraid.

361
00:36:57,430 --> 00:36:59,170
I don't know what you know,
Kosses.

362
00:36:59,630 --> 00:37:01,350
But there is something I know.

363
00:37:02,320 --> 00:37:05,140
Osman was never to work with us.

364
00:37:05,140 --> 00:37:07,140
Pull yourself together, Gündüz Bey!

365
00:37:07,620 --> 00:37:12,000
I have been with Osman in Konya and
Söğüt.

366
00:37:12,160 --> 00:37:14,460
Choose your words wisely!

367
00:37:14,460 --> 00:37:16,460
It is not the time to choose words!

368
00:37:17,180 --> 00:37:19,740
It is time to know who is with you.

369
00:37:20,160 --> 00:37:22,800
Because you don't look for the reason
of the betrayal.

370
00:37:23,800 --> 00:37:25,860
You only punish.

371
00:37:31,050 --> 00:37:32,870
Turks!

372
00:37:34,300 --> 00:37:37,560
Stop! Don't you have any manners?

373
00:37:37,560 --> 00:37:40,760
I told you, the woman is pregnant!

374
00:37:40,760 --> 00:37:42,200
Shut up!

375
00:37:42,710 --> 00:37:43,580
Soldiers!

376
00:37:53,870 --> 00:37:56,230
Malhun Hatun, drop your sword!

377
00:37:56,790 --> 00:37:58,750
Selcen Hatun, Bala Hatun!

378
00:37:59,220 --> 00:38:01,120
Come here nicely!

379
00:38:01,120 --> 00:38:04,160
Or I won't fear spilling any blood!

380
00:38:04,160 --> 00:38:06,160
I am out of my patience!

381
00:38:10,820 --> 00:38:14,980
You and that rebel Osman will be punished.

382
00:38:16,730 --> 00:38:19,710
Don't you understand a word we are saying?

383
00:38:22,170 --> 00:38:24,050
Why did you come again, devil?

384
00:38:24,370 --> 00:38:27,530
I came to arrest you, Selcen Hatun.

385
00:38:28,980 --> 00:38:33,340
What did we do that you are arresting us?

386
00:38:33,340 --> 00:38:36,560
You ask as if you don't know, old woman.

387
00:38:37,620 --> 00:38:43,520
You help your rebel son and
betray the state of Seljuk.

388
00:38:45,990 --> 00:38:48,330
Here she is.

389
00:38:52,940 --> 00:38:56,020
You can't stop lying, can you?

390
00:38:57,670 --> 00:39:00,530
You told me the hatun was giving birth.

391
00:39:00,530 --> 00:39:02,510
She is here in front of me.

392
00:39:02,510 --> 00:39:04,510
Don't confuse us with yourself.

393
00:39:04,870 --> 00:39:06,510
There is no lying about this.

394
00:39:07,190 --> 00:39:09,610
The birth started, we make her walk so--

395
00:39:09,830 --> 00:39:11,510
Shut up!

396
00:39:12,560 --> 00:39:13,980
I believe what I see.

397
00:39:14,660 --> 00:39:17,280
She can hang on until Söğüt like this.

398
00:39:19,130 --> 00:39:20,030
Soldiers!

399
00:39:20,390 --> 00:39:21,990
Tie them all!

400
00:39:25,630 --> 00:39:28,390
Let us come and let Bala Hatun stay.

401
00:39:28,670 --> 00:39:30,310
Malhun is right.

402
00:39:30,310 --> 00:39:31,750
She can't walk.

403
00:39:31,750 --> 00:39:32,850
The birth started.

404
00:39:32,850 --> 00:39:34,250
We will come with you.

405
00:39:34,250 --> 00:39:37,350
Hurry up, tie them all!
Come on!

406
00:39:37,350 --> 00:39:38,810
Get off of me!

407
00:39:38,810 --> 00:39:40,130
What kind of a man are you?

408
00:39:40,670 --> 00:39:42,630
I can't even call you human!

409
00:39:42,630 --> 00:39:45,310
Calling you an animal is an
insult to animals!

410
00:39:45,560 --> 00:39:46,780
What are you, huh?

411
00:39:48,630 --> 00:39:52,150
This is the end, Hatuns.

412
00:40:22,480 --> 00:40:24,210
Brother!

413
00:40:41,280 --> 00:40:42,770
Are you alright?

414
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:44,720
I'm, my bey.

415
00:40:49,720 --> 00:40:55,280
Because of these traps, we can't
catch Geyhatu.

416
00:40:58,140 --> 00:41:01,820
We'll destroy all his traps, my bey.

417
00:41:06,520 --> 00:41:10,820
He is wounded. That's why
he is taking the easy road.

418
00:41:13,010 --> 00:41:18,450
We'll take the high hills and
cliffs.

419
00:41:18,700 --> 00:41:21,270
You'll go right.

420
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:23,510
We'll go left.

421
00:41:24,030 --> 00:41:27,240
-We'll come Geyhatu's way.
-Alright, my bey.

422
00:41:27,460 --> 00:41:29,900
But there are many caves
around here.

423
00:41:30,270 --> 00:41:34,360
He might come after us instead.

424
00:41:35,140 --> 00:41:37,440
Boran will go over the high ground.

425
00:41:37,710 --> 00:41:41,370
We'll check every hole down here.

426
00:41:42,340 --> 00:41:44,070
As you order, my bey.

427
00:41:44,480 --> 00:41:46,690
May Allah bless our jihad.

428
00:41:46,830 --> 00:41:47,750
Come on.

429
00:41:54,300 --> 00:41:56,300
Thank you, brother.

430
00:42:08,990 --> 00:42:10,390
Aygül.

431
00:42:10,830 --> 00:42:12,450
Move! Move!

432
00:42:13,640 --> 00:42:14,690
Ayşe Hatun...

433
00:42:14,800 --> 00:42:17,290
what's happening?
-Don't even ask, Aygül.

434
00:42:17,670 --> 00:42:18,890
The vizier.

435
00:42:19,160 --> 00:42:23,050
-He is arresting my mother, Malhun, Bala.
-What are you saying?

436
00:42:23,220 --> 00:42:29,030
-Bala, the baby! Isn't she giving birth?
-Yes, but he isn't listening.

437
00:42:29,600 --> 00:42:31,550
He'll take them to Söğüt.

438
00:42:32,120 --> 00:42:32,980
What?

439
00:42:33,170 --> 00:42:37,150
-I'll show them!
-Stop! Come! Wait.

440
00:42:37,280 --> 00:42:40,690
He has surrounded the tribe
with soldiers.

441
00:42:40,880 --> 00:42:45,150
Go and inform Gündüz and Osman Bey.
We can't help them alone.

442
00:42:45,320 --> 00:42:47,830
But maybe Gündüz can convince
the vizier.

443
00:42:49,000 --> 00:42:50,510
Go to Harmankaya.

444
00:42:50,730 --> 00:42:51,700
Harmankaya.

445
00:42:51,840 --> 00:42:53,890
Gündüz was going there.

446
00:42:54,510 --> 00:42:56,560
Get there in time, Aygül.

447
00:42:56,810 --> 00:42:59,820
Bala can't take all that road
in this condition.

448
00:43:00,010 --> 00:43:03,060
Alright, Ayşe Hatun.
Be careful.

449
00:43:03,060 --> 00:43:07,270
-Keep your eyes open.
-Be careful.

450
00:43:11,150 --> 00:43:13,290
What's your name?
Where are you going, woman?

451
00:43:14,020 --> 00:43:16,720
Get out of my and save me the trouble.

452
00:43:16,830 --> 00:43:19,700
Are you from the rebellious
Osman's family?

453
00:43:32,900 --> 00:43:34,520
Thank you, Ayşe.

454
00:43:34,520 --> 00:43:35,360
Come on.

455
00:43:41,290 --> 00:43:42,420
Come on.

456
00:43:54,430 --> 00:43:56,060
Kayı Tribe!

457
00:43:58,660 --> 00:44:02,520
What I do shouldn't be regarded
as tyranny.

458
00:44:03,280 --> 00:44:06,690
My only wish is the good of
your tribe.

459
00:44:09,070 --> 00:44:13,530
These women were helping the
rebel named Osman.

460
00:44:13,720 --> 00:44:16,670
For that reason, they'll be trialed.

461
00:44:16,890 --> 00:44:19,270
Mother Selcan is the mother
of the Kayı Tribe!

462
00:44:19,730 --> 00:44:21,350
Bala Hatun is pregnant!

463
00:44:23,540 --> 00:44:27,760
We'll protect the precious of Osman bey!

464
00:44:31,090 --> 00:44:32,770
Let him go!

465
00:44:33,470 --> 00:44:35,230
Don't touch them!

466
00:44:41,880 --> 00:44:44,510
We are coming as you want.

467
00:44:46,650 --> 00:44:51,460
An insult against me is an insult
against Sultan Mesut.

468
00:44:53,760 --> 00:44:58,470
Revolting to the state has only one
punishment.

469
00:45:06,180 --> 00:45:07,420
Traitors!

470
00:45:07,450 --> 00:45:11,210
Vizier, I hope you get strangled.

471
00:45:11,320 --> 00:45:15,830
You'll carry the blood of
the innocent on your hands forever.

472
00:45:16,380 --> 00:45:18,780
You will answer for this, vizier.

473
00:45:18,920 --> 00:45:22,080
You'll answer for every innocent
you killed.

474
00:45:27,410 --> 00:45:28,580
Come on.

475
00:45:48,970 --> 00:45:54,300
Kayı Tribe, look what this damned
man does.

476
00:45:54,440 --> 00:45:59,880
See it and understand how
right Osman Bey was.

477
00:46:00,580 --> 00:46:03,010
Let our ladies go!

478
00:46:14,570 --> 00:46:19,220
Am I allowed? Orhan is so little.
He shouldn't get cold.

479
00:46:35,940 --> 00:46:38,020
Aygül went to inform.

480
00:46:41,970 --> 00:46:43,940
May Allah help you.

481
00:46:46,430 --> 00:46:48,220
Thank you, Ayşe Hatun.

482
00:46:50,440 --> 00:46:52,490
Retreat the soldiers at the tribe.

483
00:46:52,680 --> 00:46:54,580
I have all his family.

484
00:46:54,850 --> 00:46:58,070
I'll find Gündüz too, wherever
he is.

485
00:46:58,580 --> 00:47:01,720
The cart will slow us down.
We'll go ahead.

486
00:47:01,850 --> 00:47:03,310
Be careful.

487
00:47:03,530 --> 00:47:05,290
I don't want any mistakes.

488
00:47:11,320 --> 00:47:13,300
I'm alright.

489
00:48:01,580 --> 00:48:05,050
Harmankaya Castle

490
00:48:06,480 --> 00:48:07,290
Mari.

491
00:48:07,750 --> 00:48:08,910
Aygül.

492
00:48:09,560 --> 00:48:11,380
Are you alright?

493
00:48:11,540 --> 00:48:13,130
What happened?
How's everyone?

494
00:48:13,300 --> 00:48:14,840
Bad things happened, Mari.

495
00:48:15,060 --> 00:48:18,550
That snake vizier raided the tribe.
He took the ladies.

496
00:48:19,710 --> 00:48:21,170
Dishonorable vizier.

497
00:48:21,520 --> 00:48:22,930
He doesn't think.

498
00:48:23,060 --> 00:48:26,010
I'll take his brain out!

499
00:48:26,230 --> 00:48:29,150
I need to talk to Gündüz Bey.
I heard that he is here.

500
00:48:29,470 --> 00:48:31,070
He and my brother left.

501
00:48:31,100 --> 00:48:33,400
Where, Mari?
We don't have time.

502
00:48:33,400 --> 00:48:36,290
I don't know!
They left suddenly.

503
00:48:36,430 --> 00:48:38,960
Aygül, I want to help!

504
00:48:38,990 --> 00:48:39,730
Mari, look.

505
00:48:39,780 --> 00:48:43,080
Bala Hatun, Malhun Hatun, Mother Selcan,
you are my family.

506
00:48:43,080 --> 00:48:46,110
Mari, you are pregnant.
You must protect your baby.

507
00:48:46,920 --> 00:48:47,760
Alright?

508
00:48:48,110 --> 00:48:50,440
What will you do?

509
00:48:50,630 --> 00:48:52,850
I can't lose time by looking
for Gündüz Bey.

510
00:48:52,960 --> 00:48:55,280
I'll find Osman Bey.

511
00:49:06,350 --> 00:49:08,240
Ready the soldiers.
We are leaving.

512
00:49:08,430 --> 00:49:09,430
As you order.

513
00:49:09,570 --> 00:49:12,300
-But, my lady--
-We are leaving, Cornelia!

514
00:49:13,240 --> 00:49:15,220
I'll do anything for my family.

515
00:49:15,650 --> 00:49:18,680
My child will learn to fight for
its family first.

516
00:49:36,480 --> 00:49:38,970
You will be fine, brother.
You will be fine.

517
00:49:39,860 --> 00:49:42,110
You are fine, brother.
You are fine.

518
00:49:42,790 --> 00:49:44,350
Look here!

519
00:49:45,630 --> 00:49:48,930
Aren't you humans?
Give us clean water!

520
00:49:52,360 --> 00:49:55,660
What are you looking at?
Give us clean water!

521
00:50:01,840 --> 00:50:03,660
This won't do.

522
00:50:04,770 --> 00:50:06,630
We have to leave here.

523
00:50:11,420 --> 00:50:17,370
Brothers. Lift me to the cage when
it gets dark.

524
00:50:23,040 --> 00:50:27,110
After surviving to the night,
we'll find a way.

525
00:50:33,720 --> 00:50:35,860
Cerkutay.

526
00:50:36,440 --> 00:50:39,410
Hold yourself together.

527
00:50:39,540 --> 00:50:41,540
Hang on, Cerkutay.

528
00:50:41,640 --> 00:50:43,430
Hang on!

529
00:50:45,290 --> 00:50:49,700
Cerkutay! Cerkutay!
Hang on!

530
00:50:49,770 --> 00:50:51,270
Brother!

531
00:50:51,380 --> 00:50:53,620
Pull yourself together!

532
00:50:53,650 --> 00:50:56,090
Brother!
Cerkutay!

533
00:50:56,440 --> 00:51:01,410
Cerkutay can't die!
Brother!

534
00:51:01,890 --> 00:51:03,540
Dishonorable!

535
00:51:04,420 --> 00:51:06,760
Give us clean water!

536
00:51:10,280 --> 00:51:11,960
Brother!
Cerkutay!

537
00:51:12,480 --> 00:51:15,150
Cerkutay, open your eyes!

538
00:51:40,470 --> 00:51:44,990
Follow these tracks.
I'll wait here.

539
00:52:35,110 --> 00:52:40,310
The vizier was right.
You are up to something, Konur.

540
00:52:58,320 --> 00:53:00,240
Damn it.

541
00:53:26,340 --> 00:53:28,950
Alps...

542
00:53:52,130 --> 00:53:54,150
Osman...

543
00:53:55,110 --> 00:53:57,420
Where are you, Osman?

544
00:54:47,960 --> 00:54:51,510
I'm here, Turgut Bey!

545
00:56:12,540 --> 00:56:13,780
Get up!

546
00:57:26,680 --> 00:57:28,750
Come on, brother.

547
00:57:51,510 --> 00:57:54,660
-Boran!
-Konur!

548
00:57:54,690 --> 00:57:56,240
Konur!

549
00:58:05,360 --> 00:58:07,360
We were separated, brother.

550
00:58:07,560 --> 00:58:11,160
We are together, brother.

551
00:58:12,650 --> 00:58:14,780
I'm here, thank Allah.

552
00:58:15,080 --> 00:58:16,320
Thank Allah.

553
00:58:30,280 --> 00:58:32,240
Are you alright?

554
00:58:32,490 --> 00:58:34,040
We are, my bey.

555
00:58:35,190 --> 00:58:40,290
No matter how good he is, a weasel
can't kill a wolf.

556
00:58:40,530 --> 00:58:41,800
Right, brother?

557
00:58:41,890 --> 00:58:43,370
Yes, Turgut Bey.

558
00:58:43,560 --> 00:58:44,830
Yes.

559
00:58:45,040 --> 00:58:46,090
Yes.

560
00:58:47,690 --> 00:58:49,880
The vizier sent me, my bey.

561
00:58:50,160 --> 00:58:52,700
I got rid of the soldiers.

562
00:58:54,750 --> 00:58:57,870
I don't have my alps with me.

563
00:58:58,980 --> 00:59:01,810
The vizier must have them.

564
00:59:02,250 --> 00:59:05,130
We won't leave my brothers to them.

565
00:59:08,050 --> 00:59:12,840
I didn't know, my bey. I went after
you into the forest.

566
00:59:15,480 --> 00:59:18,270
You are working with Osman, Konur.

567
00:59:18,670 --> 00:59:23,100
You turn your back to Konya and
be loyal to a bey.

568
00:59:24,800 --> 00:59:27,640
We don't know what that vizier
is up to.

569
00:59:28,320 --> 00:59:32,210
Spend some time in the forest
and return to him.

570
00:59:32,540 --> 00:59:34,470
Say that you couldn't find us.

571
00:59:36,220 --> 00:59:40,290
We won't return before taking
Geyhatu's life.

572
00:59:40,920 --> 00:59:43,240
As you order, my bey.

573
00:59:43,820 --> 00:59:45,830
Come on, brother.

574
00:59:52,620 --> 00:59:54,680
Come on.

575
01:00:20,550 --> 01:00:22,050
My child.

576
01:00:22,890 --> 01:00:26,010
Our child is coming.
Where are you, Osman?

577
01:00:27,630 --> 01:00:29,570
Bala, are you alright?

578
01:00:31,410 --> 01:00:33,490
I'm feeling some pain.

579
01:00:33,490 --> 01:00:36,150
It feels like my inside is crushed
as this cart swings.

580
01:00:39,010 --> 01:00:40,830
Slow! Slow!

581
01:00:40,830 --> 01:00:43,070
The woman is pregnant!
She is giving birth.

582
01:00:43,070 --> 01:00:45,070
Aren't you afraid of Allah?

583
01:00:45,070 --> 01:00:47,070
Stop and let us give her
a drop of water.

584
01:00:50,390 --> 01:00:51,350
Give them water.

585
01:00:52,410 --> 01:00:53,570
Give it to me.

586
01:00:56,930 --> 01:00:59,270
Bala, drink it slowly.

587
01:00:59,270 --> 01:01:00,830
Slowly, slowly.

588
01:01:01,570 --> 01:01:02,410
Is it good?

589
01:01:06,770 --> 01:01:07,610
Malhun.

590
01:01:08,310 --> 01:01:09,710
This won't do, my daughter.

591
01:01:10,090 --> 01:01:12,710
The baby is coming.
We must do something.

592
01:01:15,930 --> 01:01:17,310
Bala!

593
01:01:59,650 --> 01:02:02,170
Rogatus Lasgaris.

594
01:02:03,890 --> 01:02:06,330
He fought for Bilecik all his life.

595
01:02:07,470 --> 01:02:11,010
And he died when he was fighting
for the people of Bilecik.

596
01:02:12,370 --> 01:02:14,410
His soul must be in peace.

597
01:02:18,390 --> 01:02:20,330
What about you, Gündüz Bey?

598
01:02:21,590 --> 01:02:25,510
Are you still judging us over Nikola?

599
01:02:27,410 --> 01:02:29,170
We are fighting alongside you...

600
01:02:30,410 --> 01:02:32,350
and dying alongside you.

601
01:02:34,730 --> 01:02:36,150
Thank you, Kosses.

602
01:02:38,230 --> 01:02:39,490
Thank you.

603
01:02:41,130 --> 01:02:41,970
Wait.

604
01:02:49,910 --> 01:02:51,370
Bamsı Bey's swords.

605
01:02:52,690 --> 01:02:53,810
Bamsı Bey?

606
01:02:56,470 --> 01:02:58,550
Ah, Cerkutay!
Ah!

607
01:02:59,330 --> 01:03:01,190
My Allah, protect them!

608
01:03:11,590 --> 01:03:12,440
My bey!

609
01:03:13,150 --> 01:03:14,070
Gündüz Bey!

610
01:03:15,870 --> 01:03:18,110
My warrior!
Are you alright?

611
01:03:19,810 --> 01:03:20,970
I'm fine but...

612
01:03:21,390 --> 01:03:23,950
the vizier took all the alps.

613
01:03:31,110 --> 01:03:32,190
Alps!

614
01:03:32,610 --> 01:03:34,730
Take our brother to the
brother! Go!

615
01:03:39,990 --> 01:03:43,730
Osman Bey. Do you think the vizier
have him?

616
01:03:46,110 --> 01:03:47,250
I don't think so.

617
01:03:47,810 --> 01:03:49,570
If he had captured Osman...

618
01:03:49,570 --> 01:03:51,790
he would announce it to the
whole world.

619
01:03:55,590 --> 01:03:58,270
Osman must be after Geyhatu.

620
01:04:01,570 --> 01:04:03,270
Return to your castle, Kosses.

621
01:04:03,710 --> 01:04:05,410
I'll keep searching for Osman Bey.

622
01:04:06,410 --> 01:04:08,330
Stop there, Gündüz Bey.

623
01:04:09,410 --> 01:04:12,770
We'll go together to search for Osman.

624
01:04:30,050 --> 01:04:31,170
Mari!
Mari!

625
01:04:42,430 --> 01:04:43,410
Mother!

626
01:04:54,770 --> 01:04:57,290
We called you our sister for a reason!

627
01:04:57,290 --> 01:04:59,290
Cornelia, hold Orhan.

628
01:05:11,930 --> 01:05:12,760
Come.

629
01:05:23,770 --> 01:05:25,850
Slowly!
Slowly!

630
01:05:26,890 --> 01:05:28,350
Come on.
Come on.

631
01:05:28,350 --> 01:05:31,490
Come on.

632
01:05:31,950 --> 01:05:33,730
Hang on!

633
01:05:37,930 --> 01:05:39,030
Come.

634
01:05:39,030 --> 01:05:40,010
Mother!

635
01:05:44,030 --> 01:05:45,230
Bala!

636
01:05:50,310 --> 01:05:51,390
Come on, my girl.

637
01:05:51,390 --> 01:05:52,670
Come on.

638
01:06:26,510 --> 01:06:27,970
Keşik.

639
01:06:34,610 --> 01:06:37,670
Were they protecting Genghis like this?

640
01:06:38,290 --> 01:06:42,730
Why did none of the warriors
return?

641
01:06:42,870 --> 01:06:45,990
Because they were trained to die,
not to return.

642
01:06:46,190 --> 01:06:47,250
This is why.

643
01:06:47,250 --> 01:06:49,250
And they died.

644
01:06:54,270 --> 01:06:59,190
Now, I'll personally fight.

645
01:07:00,250 --> 01:07:04,730
This cave will be Osman's grave!

646
01:07:10,430 --> 01:07:13,630
Hang on! Hang on!

647
01:07:13,630 --> 01:07:16,010
Hang on!

648
01:07:16,890 --> 01:07:19,510
We can't go like this.

649
01:07:19,510 --> 01:07:20,390
It begins.

650
01:07:20,490 --> 01:07:22,410
Come on!

651
01:07:22,890 --> 01:07:26,010
Bala! Hang on a little longer!

652
01:07:26,010 --> 01:07:28,750
My Allah!
Protect my child!

653
01:07:47,030 --> 01:07:47,990
Alps!

654
01:07:48,690 --> 01:07:49,450
My bey.

655
01:07:49,850 --> 01:07:51,350
Be careful.

656
01:07:51,590 --> 01:07:53,010
Alright, my bey.

657
01:08:31,250 --> 01:08:33,430
Look at this.

658
01:08:43,090 --> 01:08:44,850
They are setting traps.

659
01:08:44,850 --> 01:08:47,550
But this can only slow us.

660
01:08:50,689 --> 01:08:52,710
We won't give up.

661
01:08:53,310 --> 01:08:54,810
A little bit more, brothers.

662
01:08:54,810 --> 01:08:56,810
The traps don't look old.

663
01:08:57,350 --> 01:08:58,729
We are close.

664
01:08:58,729 --> 01:09:00,729
We are.

665
01:09:00,890 --> 01:09:03,029
As close as their breath.

666
01:09:05,050 --> 01:09:08,069
It's better to be cautious.

667
01:09:08,069 --> 01:09:09,130
Alright, my bey.

668
01:09:11,910 --> 01:09:12,870
Come on.

669
01:10:00,950 --> 01:10:03,330
Dogs are trying to eat the cage!

670
01:10:15,310 --> 01:10:18,950
The vizier said that the captives
wouldn't sit silently.

671
01:10:19,470 --> 01:10:20,750
He was right.

672
01:10:20,750 --> 01:10:23,940
What good comes from being right
if you aren't the right person?

673
01:10:24,770 --> 01:10:27,910
We are fighting for Allah's words.

674
01:10:29,730 --> 01:10:31,130
What's your purpose?

675
01:10:32,310 --> 01:10:35,690
They are just serving the vizier.

676
01:10:36,410 --> 01:10:38,250
Keep seeing us as rebels.

677
01:10:38,710 --> 01:10:40,250
We won't step back.

678
01:10:41,330 --> 01:10:43,030
As you have this cage...

679
01:10:43,290 --> 01:10:45,030
you can't do anything.

680
01:10:45,450 --> 01:10:47,830
Go and get your last sleep.

681
01:11:10,590 --> 01:11:12,610
Allah is great.

682
01:11:17,670 --> 01:11:21,990
So, Nikola wants to build an
alliance with me again.

683
01:11:21,990 --> 01:11:24,310
Lord Nikola wants to stand with power.

684
01:11:29,730 --> 01:11:32,830
We aren't desperate to hold onto
desperate situations.

685
01:11:36,830 --> 01:11:40,970
Those who see their graves ready,
want to stand with us.

686
01:11:42,870 --> 01:11:46,260
Holes are dangerous for anyone who
don't see what's in front of them.

687
01:11:46,310 --> 01:11:48,990
Your alliance with my lord Nikola
will give you power.

688
01:11:49,390 --> 01:11:51,210
Think about it, my vizier.

689
01:11:55,990 --> 01:11:58,250
Let's think about it.

690
01:12:04,310 --> 01:12:07,690
I don't need to be allies with Nikola.

691
01:12:09,590 --> 01:12:10,950
Konur.

692
01:12:21,290 --> 01:12:23,050
You can leave, Konur.

693
01:12:33,470 --> 01:12:35,390
Now, go to Osman...

694
01:12:36,070 --> 01:12:40,210
and tell him that we are enemies
with Nikola.

695
01:12:45,810 --> 01:12:48,090
You were right to be suspicious,
my vizier.

696
01:12:48,310 --> 01:12:50,530
Konur got rid of the soldiers first...

697
01:12:52,210 --> 01:12:54,210
and then he fought alongside Osman.

698
01:12:55,970 --> 01:12:57,750
He is loyal to Osman.

699
01:12:59,990 --> 01:13:03,710
I should behead him and send
his skull to Konya.

700
01:13:06,210 --> 01:13:11,450
But I'll use him more smartly.

701
01:13:14,030 --> 01:13:17,070
He should stay loyal to Osman.

702
01:13:18,330 --> 01:13:20,430
Disloyal dog!

703
01:13:20,870 --> 01:13:24,630
And you say that you couldn't
find Osman, huh?

704
01:13:26,970 --> 01:13:29,790
Anyway. Anyway.

705
01:13:30,510 --> 01:13:31,910
May I enter, my vizier?

706
01:13:32,550 --> 01:13:33,930
Come in.

707
01:13:38,810 --> 01:13:44,090
My vizier, ladies escaped on their
way to here.

708
01:13:45,450 --> 01:13:47,510
Harmankaya soldiers attacked.

709
01:13:53,950 --> 01:13:55,050
Erbey!

710
01:13:55,050 --> 01:13:56,250
Yes, my vizier.

711
01:13:56,510 --> 01:13:58,070
Get some soldiers...

712
01:13:58,470 --> 01:13:59,970
and this idiot.

713
01:14:00,950 --> 01:14:03,510
See where they ran into.

714
01:14:04,110 --> 01:14:08,050
Search everywhere!

715
01:14:08,850 --> 01:14:10,710
Bring them to me!

716
01:14:11,730 --> 01:14:13,270
Consider it done, my vizier.

717
01:14:15,270 --> 01:14:16,210
Come on!

718
01:14:31,310 --> 01:14:33,630
Come here, it's good here.

719
01:14:33,630 --> 01:14:34,690
Get here.

720
01:14:34,870 --> 01:14:35,750
Get here.

721
01:14:35,750 --> 01:14:38,230
We are here, Bala.
We are here. Slowly.

722
01:14:39,190 --> 01:14:40,310
Come.

723
01:14:42,210 --> 01:14:45,670
Sit slowly. Come on.

724
01:14:46,590 --> 01:14:47,910
Hang on, Bala!

725
01:14:47,910 --> 01:14:49,450
It'll all be over.

726
01:14:50,050 --> 01:14:52,270
It'll all be over!

727
01:14:57,370 --> 01:14:58,350
Hang on, Bala!

728
01:14:58,350 --> 01:15:00,890
Just a little bit more, Bala!

729
01:15:01,290 --> 01:15:02,290
Hang on.

730
01:15:02,970 --> 01:15:04,090
Hang on, Bala!

731
01:15:06,130 --> 01:15:08,030
Alright.

732
01:15:08,410 --> 01:15:09,360
Bala...

733
01:15:10,870 --> 01:15:11,930
Drink this.

734
01:15:12,270 --> 01:15:13,410
Drink some water.

735
01:15:13,970 --> 01:15:15,950
Drink it.

736
01:15:19,210 --> 01:15:23,210
Mari, we'll set fire.
We need to boil water.

737
01:15:23,210 --> 01:15:25,210
Go and gather some sticks
or something!

738
01:15:25,210 --> 01:15:26,280
Alright.

739
01:15:27,330 --> 01:15:28,990
Hang on!

740
01:15:28,990 --> 01:15:29,910
Come on!

741
01:15:34,370 --> 01:15:35,610
Malhun.

742
01:15:36,430 --> 01:15:37,610
We need cloth.
Hold this.

743
01:15:37,610 --> 01:15:38,590
Yes, mother.

744
01:15:39,130 --> 01:15:40,530
Hold on.

745
01:15:45,430 --> 01:15:47,690
Mother, what's the situation?

746
01:15:48,910 --> 01:15:51,070
She hanged on good.

747
01:15:51,070 --> 01:15:53,070
She is too tired.

748
01:15:53,330 --> 01:15:54,590
I'm afraid.

749
01:15:55,510 --> 01:15:58,750
May Allah protect her and the baby.

750
01:15:58,970 --> 01:16:00,310
Inshallah, mother.

751
01:16:00,310 --> 01:16:01,070
Inshallah.

752
01:16:14,210 --> 01:16:16,570
The traps stopped Osman.

753
01:16:17,230 --> 01:16:20,690
The traps won't stop Osman.

754
01:16:20,690 --> 01:16:23,990
It'll be my bloody hands,
Mingiyan.

755
01:16:24,850 --> 01:16:26,510
I'll kill him!

756
01:16:29,370 --> 01:16:32,710
When Temuçin(Genghis Khan) lost his
father...

757
01:16:32,710 --> 01:16:35,850
his tribe didn't want him.

758
01:16:36,070 --> 01:16:39,870
He was little.
They banished him.

759
01:16:41,270 --> 01:16:45,290
They took his herd, his property.

760
01:16:46,510 --> 01:16:48,750
Most importantly...

761
01:16:50,610 --> 01:16:52,430
they took his sword.

762
01:16:54,390 --> 01:16:58,490
Onon River fed Temuçin.

763
01:16:58,650 --> 01:17:01,510
The mountains raised him.

764
01:17:01,510 --> 01:17:04,030
He set traps for his enemies.

765
01:17:04,030 --> 01:17:07,590
He destroyed the ones who
despised him.

766
01:17:07,590 --> 01:17:12,290
Sky Tengri blessed him!

767
01:17:12,430 --> 01:17:15,810
With the blessing,
he got stronger.

768
01:17:17,890 --> 01:17:21,290
He didn't have a horse.
He tamed a deer!

769
01:17:21,830 --> 01:17:24,990
He didn't have a sword.
He sculpted a stone!

770
01:17:25,170 --> 01:17:30,030
He didn't have a bow.
He bent a branch!

771
01:17:30,330 --> 01:17:34,210
But he didn't give up.
He lived...

772
01:17:34,210 --> 01:17:38,070
and he brought death to those
who stood against him.

773
01:17:39,810 --> 01:17:43,010
They thought Temuçin was just a child.

774
01:17:43,010 --> 01:17:45,670
He received the blessing of Tengri.

775
01:17:46,210 --> 01:17:48,170
He became Genghis Khan!

776
01:18:04,450 --> 01:18:06,150
I have that blessing!

777
01:18:06,490 --> 01:18:10,310
I do! I do! I do!

778
01:18:10,350 --> 01:18:14,990
I will live and bring death upon
my enemies!

779
01:18:16,290 --> 01:18:17,510
Hang on, my daughter.

780
01:18:18,390 --> 01:18:21,590
Hang on, Bala!

781
01:18:21,950 --> 01:18:26,030
Come on, hang on a little longer!

782
01:18:26,410 --> 01:18:27,590
Hang on, Bala!

783
01:18:30,830 --> 01:18:32,810
I'm powerless, mother.

784
01:18:33,010 --> 01:18:34,270
Hang on, Bala.

785
01:18:34,490 --> 01:18:36,510
Hang on!
You are a strong woman.

786
01:18:36,510 --> 01:18:37,410
Hang on!

787
01:18:38,530 --> 01:18:39,470
Come on.

788
01:18:42,730 --> 01:18:43,750
Malhun.

789
01:18:44,390 --> 01:18:46,350
Go and check Orhan.

790
01:18:47,610 --> 01:18:48,710
Osman...

791
01:18:49,250 --> 01:18:51,350
Where are you, Osman?

792
01:18:51,810 --> 01:18:53,710
Bala, hang on.

793
01:18:54,150 --> 01:18:55,710
Go to Bala.

794
01:18:56,110 --> 01:18:57,130
Where are you?

795
01:18:57,530 --> 01:18:58,590
Where are you?

796
01:19:00,470 --> 01:19:03,030
Aygül will inform Osman Bey.
Hang on!

797
01:19:03,030 --> 01:19:04,390
Hang on!

798
01:19:07,710 --> 01:19:08,870
Bala.

799
01:19:09,190 --> 01:19:11,090
Listen to me well now.

800
01:19:11,310 --> 01:19:13,710
You waited a long time for
your child.

801
01:19:15,110 --> 01:19:17,830
But the child has little time.

802
01:19:17,830 --> 01:19:20,950
You will push for one last time,
with all your power.

803
01:19:20,950 --> 01:19:22,810
Come on, one last time.

804
01:19:22,810 --> 01:19:24,810
With the name of Allah!

805
01:19:24,810 --> 01:19:25,790
Come on!

806
01:19:27,150 --> 01:19:29,770
With the name of Allah!

807
01:19:29,950 --> 01:19:32,430
Come on, my pretty girl!
With all your power!

808
01:19:32,430 --> 01:19:34,570
Come on, Bala!
With the name of Allah!

809
01:19:44,560 --> 01:19:47,430
Mashallah, Bala!
It's coming!

810
01:20:02,920 --> 01:20:03,670
My bey.

811
01:20:04,670 --> 01:20:06,870
We need to set a fire and
burn this wound.

812
01:20:07,670 --> 01:20:09,060
This will be worse.

813
01:20:09,060 --> 01:20:10,570
We are in the dark.

814
01:20:11,070 --> 01:20:13,810
If we set fire, we'll
be seen.

815
01:20:13,860 --> 01:20:14,840
Alright, my bey.

816
01:20:26,030 --> 01:20:27,690
You talked about fire.

817
01:20:28,970 --> 01:20:30,790
And here it is, Boran.

818
01:20:32,190 --> 01:20:35,230
If it's destiny, it'll come
with or without the fire.

819
01:20:37,260 --> 01:20:39,290
Now, we'll burn them.

820
01:20:40,390 --> 01:20:43,110
Ya Allah!

821
01:21:15,290 --> 01:21:16,130
Baby?

822
01:21:25,050 --> 01:21:26,130
Mother Selcan?

823
01:21:33,870 --> 01:21:34,740
Mother?

824
01:21:41,540 --> 01:21:42,330
My baby...

825
01:21:45,580 --> 01:21:46,410
Mother...

826
01:21:47,810 --> 01:21:49,330
Why isn't it crying?

827
01:21:55,410 --> 01:21:57,050
Why isn't it crying?

828
01:22:01,580 --> 01:22:04,010
-Mother?
-Say something!

829
01:22:04,930 --> 01:22:06,520
Why isn't my baby crying?

830
01:22:07,160 --> 01:22:08,670
Mother, say something!

831
01:22:08,670 --> 01:22:09,500
Alright.

832
01:22:09,700 --> 01:22:11,580
Mother, why isn't my baby crying?

833
01:22:11,580 --> 01:22:13,920
Malhun! What will I do?

834
01:22:15,860 --> 01:22:17,770
No! No!

835
01:22:17,770 --> 01:22:18,690
What will I do?

836
01:22:20,070 --> 01:22:21,760
What will I do?

837
01:22:22,040 --> 01:22:24,390
No! No! Mother!

838
01:22:24,390 --> 01:22:26,470
Why isn't my baby crying?

839
01:22:26,470 --> 01:22:27,520
Why not?

840
01:22:28,180 --> 01:22:29,520
Why not?

841
01:22:29,880 --> 01:22:33,030
Come on, I beg you!
Come on!

842
01:22:33,370 --> 01:22:34,790
Come on!

843
01:22:34,790 --> 01:22:37,100
Say something!
No! No!

844
01:22:37,100 --> 01:22:40,620
No! No!
My baby!

845
01:22:40,990 --> 01:22:44,150
Come on, my precious one!
I beg you!

846
01:22:44,150 --> 01:22:45,720
Come on!

847
01:22:45,720 --> 01:22:48,760
My child! My child! No!

848
01:23:10,220 --> 01:23:12,180
Thank Allah!

849
01:23:12,870 --> 01:23:14,540
Thank Allah!

850
01:23:15,260 --> 01:23:17,420
Thank Allah!

851
01:23:18,430 --> 01:23:20,680
Is it a girl or a boy, Mother Selcan?

852
01:23:23,500 --> 01:23:25,550
An evangel, Bala!

853
01:23:26,640 --> 01:23:27,920
Thank Allah!

854
01:23:28,800 --> 01:23:30,230
My child!

855
01:23:38,470 --> 01:23:41,380
My child!
My child!

856
01:23:43,040 --> 01:23:44,430
Thank Allah.

857
01:23:51,600 --> 01:23:54,700
Thank Allah!
Thank Allah!

858
01:23:54,950 --> 01:23:56,800
Thank Allah!

859
01:23:57,950 --> 01:23:59,070
Thank Allah!

860
01:24:34,500 --> 01:24:38,670
Did you learn to fight like this
in Karabağ, Gencebey?

861
01:24:39,230 --> 01:24:41,550
Aren't we all the same, Turgut Bey?

862
01:24:41,860 --> 01:24:43,840
We all fight good.

863
01:24:45,090 --> 01:24:46,480
Good job, brother.

864
01:24:47,200 --> 01:24:49,870
We all fight against the tyrants.

865
01:24:51,030 --> 01:24:53,090
This is what unites us.

866
01:24:55,720 --> 01:24:56,910
Now...

867
01:24:58,820 --> 01:25:00,350
come on.

868
01:25:14,540 --> 01:25:15,860
Search everywhere!

869
01:25:15,860 --> 01:25:17,130
Come on!

870
01:25:31,940 --> 01:25:33,230
Osman...

871
01:25:35,530 --> 01:25:40,160
I've seen many cities and villages burn.

872
01:25:47,440 --> 01:25:50,550
I burnt most of them.

873
01:25:51,010 --> 01:25:54,720
I burnt them!
I did!

874
01:25:54,720 --> 01:25:57,700
I've seen many corpses.

875
01:26:01,490 --> 01:26:04,750
I killed most of them!

876
01:26:05,030 --> 01:26:10,040
I did it!

877
01:26:10,330 --> 01:26:13,400
Hundreds of calamities happened.

878
01:26:15,720 --> 01:26:18,400
I did all of them!

879
01:26:19,170 --> 01:26:23,350
Your tribe will only be one
of them, Osman.

880
01:26:24,440 --> 01:26:25,780
Just one of them.

881
01:26:31,750 --> 01:26:36,810
I'll get into your tribe like
Genghis' burning birds.

882
01:26:37,060 --> 01:26:40,890
I will! I will!
I will!

883
01:26:42,730 --> 01:26:45,320
Even the land will burn!

884
01:26:46,320 --> 01:26:49,800
The sky won't cry to put out this fire!

885
01:26:58,600 --> 01:27:07,070
Your lineage won't even have a
grave, Osman!

886
01:27:07,600 --> 01:27:12,710
Your children, your women, your men...

887
01:27:12,710 --> 01:27:18,150
I will kill all of them!

888
01:27:25,790 --> 01:27:26,790
Blood...

889
01:27:32,250 --> 01:27:35,370
their blood will flow like a river.

890
01:27:39,870 --> 01:27:47,720
It will join the land and reach
Erlik Khan!

891
01:27:49,380 --> 01:27:52,050
It'll reach Erlik Khan!

892
01:27:55,030 --> 01:27:59,290
As you get removed from History...

893
01:28:07,720 --> 01:28:13,920
Geyhatu will live forever!

894
01:28:26,690 --> 01:28:30,230
Say it, mother.
Anything you say.

895
01:28:33,840 --> 01:28:38,110
I don't want anything but your child's
health.

896
01:28:39,000 --> 01:28:42,370
Thank Allah for these beautiful days.

897
01:28:44,860 --> 01:28:49,690
We have a son to grow
our lineage.

898
01:28:49,690 --> 01:28:51,020
Thank Allh.

899
01:28:57,500 --> 01:29:01,130
Orhan has a brother to fight
shoulder to shoulder.

900
01:29:06,280 --> 01:29:09,150
Thank Allah many times!

901
01:29:11,270 --> 01:29:12,340
My son.

902
01:29:17,030 --> 01:29:18,880
Is this real, mother?

903
01:29:20,800 --> 01:29:21,820
My son.

904
01:29:22,870 --> 01:29:25,590
May Allah protect you.

905
01:29:25,710 --> 01:29:26,810
Amin.

906
01:29:27,600 --> 01:29:28,350
Amin.

907
01:29:29,390 --> 01:29:32,330
May Allah give him a long and
good life.

908
01:29:32,950 --> 01:29:35,360
They'll be together with his brother
forever.

909
01:29:35,470 --> 01:29:37,680
Inshallah, my daughter.

910
01:29:37,680 --> 01:29:38,730
Inshallah.

911
01:29:40,990 --> 01:29:42,350
This is a miracle.

912
01:29:42,560 --> 01:29:43,320
Yes.

913
01:29:43,820 --> 01:29:47,460
This is a miracle from the creator.

914
01:29:49,780 --> 01:29:51,780
Inshallah your turn is next.

915
01:30:51,310 --> 01:30:52,110
Bala!

916
01:31:55,010 --> 01:31:56,300
Where are you, Osman?

917
01:32:00,140 --> 01:32:00,900
Where are you?

918
01:35:31,630 --> 01:35:34,800
My mighty Allah!

919
01:35:38,520 --> 01:35:40,220
I'm grateful.

920
01:35:41,810 --> 01:35:44,660
I'm most grateful.

921
01:35:46,730 --> 01:35:51,100
We've never stopped counting on you.

922
01:35:51,760 --> 01:35:53,720
We never will.

923
01:35:55,570 --> 01:35:56,860
My Allah.

924
01:35:58,790 --> 01:36:02,560
You illuminate our nights.

925
01:36:03,650 --> 01:36:08,440
My Allah, we find salvation
in your mercy.

926
01:36:09,470 --> 01:36:11,500
It is our cure.

927
01:36:12,500 --> 01:36:13,900
My Allah.

928
01:36:15,710 --> 01:36:18,490
For your holy cause...

929
01:36:20,290 --> 01:36:24,520
to swing the Islam flag in the world...

930
01:36:26,270 --> 01:36:28,730
give us strenght.

931
01:36:29,050 --> 01:36:31,860
-Amin.
-Amin.

932
01:36:33,420 --> 01:36:42,040
My Allah, you protect us from the
obstacles on our way.

933
01:36:42,220 --> 01:36:43,880
-Amin.
-Amin.

934
01:36:44,920 --> 01:36:47,200
Amin.

935
01:37:17,070 --> 01:37:18,200
Bala.

936
01:37:22,100 --> 01:37:23,330
My child.

937
01:37:27,200 --> 01:37:28,250
My Allah.

938
01:37:29,720 --> 01:37:35,310
My Allah, I hope my dream meant
something good.

939
01:37:40,070 --> 01:37:41,520
My children.

940
01:37:46,810 --> 01:37:48,050
My Allah.

941
01:37:49,670 --> 01:37:55,330
You give us salvation.

942
01:38:19,020 --> 01:38:21,230
Every hole will be searched.

943
01:38:21,470 --> 01:38:23,230
We won't return before finding
them.

944
01:38:24,120 --> 01:38:24,920
Come on.

945
01:38:26,530 --> 01:38:28,190
Clean it, Saltuk.

946
01:38:30,970 --> 01:38:33,800
Cerkutay.
Cerkutay.

947
01:38:37,840 --> 01:38:40,540
Cerkutay. Brother.

948
01:38:42,070 --> 01:38:43,120
Come on.

949
01:38:46,780 --> 01:38:49,040
I'm alright, brothers.

950
01:38:51,090 --> 01:38:52,620
I'm alright.

951
01:38:53,630 --> 01:38:57,060
Cerkutay won't lose to those dogs.

952
01:38:59,880 --> 01:39:01,380
And Cerkutay...

953
01:39:01,650 --> 01:39:04,570
doesn't die.

954
01:39:04,570 --> 01:39:06,180
Doesn't die.

955
01:39:09,060 --> 01:39:10,920
He doesn't die.

956
01:39:12,640 --> 01:39:14,550
We are fighting for the ummah...

957
01:39:15,720 --> 01:39:18,850
and look what they are doing!

958
01:39:20,910 --> 01:39:25,380
But our bey won't leave us here.

959
01:39:25,520 --> 01:39:26,420
Yes!

960
01:39:27,610 --> 01:39:32,170
They think that they imprisoned us
with that cage.

961
01:39:34,440 --> 01:39:37,040
There isn't a cage where they can
put our hearts in.

962
01:39:38,190 --> 01:39:38,990
Right?

963
01:39:39,410 --> 01:39:43,080
A brave heart can't be captured.

964
01:39:43,770 --> 01:39:46,040
It can't.

965
01:39:46,670 --> 01:39:49,150
We'll leave here.
We will.

966
01:39:49,280 --> 01:39:50,690
Inshallah, brother.

967
01:39:50,900 --> 01:39:52,360
With Allah's approval...

968
01:39:53,530 --> 01:39:54,870
we'll leave here.

969
01:39:54,870 --> 01:39:56,560
We will, inshallah.

970
01:39:58,440 --> 01:40:08,736
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

971
01:40:09,970 --> 01:40:11,270
The dog is here.

972
01:40:13,700 --> 01:40:18,110
The destiny of rebels is this.

973
01:40:19,710 --> 01:40:22,480
You are lower than animals.

974
01:40:27,170 --> 01:40:29,240
By following Osman...

975
01:40:30,570 --> 01:40:35,630
you are rebelling against
the Seljuk Vizier!

976
01:40:39,350 --> 01:40:43,970
Call your Osman Bey for help now!

977
01:40:44,290 --> 01:40:48,070
You are the one who is lower!

978
01:40:49,440 --> 01:40:51,050
We'll leave here.

979
01:40:52,160 --> 01:40:54,390
Of course, you will.

980
01:40:54,930 --> 01:40:56,830
I'm here to let you out.

981
01:40:57,750 --> 01:40:59,760
Now, it's time.

982
01:41:00,050 --> 01:41:04,680
You will leave here and be food
for weasels.

983
01:41:37,550 --> 01:41:39,410
You caught me, Osman.

984
01:41:40,090 --> 01:41:42,150
You ruled with tyranny.

985
01:41:43,480 --> 01:41:45,060
You became a tyrant.

986
01:41:47,680 --> 01:41:52,040
The shoes of your horses razed
the lands!

987
01:41:53,060 --> 01:41:55,080
You killed the innocent!

988
01:41:58,470 --> 01:41:59,640
Now...

989
01:42:01,120 --> 01:42:02,950
now it's time.

990
01:42:04,120 --> 01:42:05,410
You caught me.

991
01:42:06,900 --> 01:42:09,990
But you are late.

992
01:42:11,860 --> 01:42:16,590
I'm already at my destination.

993
01:42:17,010 --> 01:42:20,750
This is your hell.

994
01:42:48,000 --> 01:42:49,410
Geyhatu.

995
01:42:52,870 --> 01:42:56,290
With Allah's name!

996
01:43:21,940 --> 01:43:24,230
We shouldn't get far, my lady.

997
01:43:25,560 --> 01:43:28,840
Bala needs to eat, Cornelia.
She is weak.

998
01:43:53,300 --> 01:43:54,400
The traces go this way.

999
01:43:54,960 --> 01:43:56,150
There are caves ahead.

1000
01:43:56,850 --> 01:43:57,950
They must be there.

1001
01:43:58,290 --> 01:44:00,490
They can't go far with the pregnant
woman.

1002
01:44:00,910 --> 01:44:01,820
Come on.

1003
01:45:25,370 --> 01:45:27,190
I'm here, brother!

1004
01:45:30,830 --> 01:45:32,160
I'm here, my bey!

1005
01:45:36,360 --> 01:45:37,240
Shoot!

1006
01:46:21,690 --> 01:46:23,950
Osman Bey!
We must go!

1007
01:46:25,220 --> 01:46:26,510
We must go!

1008
01:46:27,000 --> 01:46:28,650
What are you saying, brother?

1009
01:46:30,510 --> 01:46:33,090
I've been waiting for this moment!

1010
01:46:33,630 --> 01:46:34,850
Why should I stop?

1011
01:46:35,410 --> 01:46:37,670
Osman Bey!
Osman Bey!

1012
01:46:38,240 --> 01:46:39,250
He has our alps!

1013
01:46:40,450 --> 01:46:44,470
The vizier raided the tribe.
He has the ladies.

1014
01:46:45,670 --> 01:46:47,560
What are you saying?

1015
01:47:03,870 --> 01:47:06,550
I'll get Mingiyan from Osman's hands.

1016
01:47:07,300 --> 01:47:09,610
He knows a lot.
I need him!

1017
01:47:15,470 --> 01:47:17,470
Where are the twenty thousand warriors?

1018
01:47:17,470 --> 01:47:18,640
Commander Geyhatu.

1019
01:47:21,540 --> 01:47:23,600
They are almost here.

1020
01:47:26,390 --> 01:47:27,360
They should.

1021
01:47:28,190 --> 01:47:34,310
They should bring doom to these
lands!

1022
01:47:34,360 --> 01:47:35,120
My bey.

1023
01:47:35,680 --> 01:47:37,610
I left to find Gündüz Bey.

1024
01:47:38,210 --> 01:47:40,470
Then, I went to Söğüt to find
them.

1025
01:47:41,310 --> 01:47:44,190
Thank Allah, they escaped.

1026
01:47:46,270 --> 01:47:48,560
Thank Allah.
Thank Allah.

1027
01:47:48,690 --> 01:47:51,350
Then I found Gündüz Bey on the
road and we came to you.

1028
01:47:52,400 --> 01:47:53,450
Thank you.

1029
01:47:54,320 --> 01:47:55,770
We must to find them.

1030
01:47:59,640 --> 01:48:01,450
The vizier has the alps.

1031
01:48:04,450 --> 01:48:05,850
We'll save the alps.

1032
01:48:06,650 --> 01:48:07,990
We'll take the ladies.

1033
01:48:09,790 --> 01:48:11,200
If it's our last resort.

1034
01:48:12,150 --> 01:48:14,580
I'll arm the remaining alps
and women.

1035
01:48:14,970 --> 01:48:18,570
I'll inform all the
friendly beys.

1036
01:48:19,060 --> 01:48:20,270
Do you give permission?

1037
01:48:21,290 --> 01:48:22,310
Thank you.

1038
01:48:23,470 --> 01:48:24,450
Send messengers.

1039
01:48:25,080 --> 01:48:27,850
Arm everyone who can hold
a sword.

1040
01:48:28,770 --> 01:48:30,310
Everyone should be ready.

1041
01:48:31,440 --> 01:48:33,540
It's heating up.

1042
01:48:34,990 --> 01:48:36,020
As you order, my bey.

1043
01:48:39,170 --> 01:48:41,040
I'll go to the ladies.

1044
01:48:41,790 --> 01:48:43,290
Alps don't need soldiers.

1045
01:48:44,490 --> 01:48:45,730
This will suffice.

1046
01:48:52,930 --> 01:48:54,240
Come here.

1047
01:48:56,240 --> 01:48:57,710
Geyhatu's secretive.

1048
01:49:00,210 --> 01:49:04,970
He knows everything about the Mongols.
Mingiyan will rule these lands...

1049
01:49:04,970 --> 01:49:11,980
when Geyhatu leaves here.
But now, he is in our hands.

1050
01:49:16,820 --> 01:49:18,210
Turgut Bey.

1051
01:49:19,450 --> 01:49:22,300
Go to our alps with him.

1052
01:49:25,550 --> 01:49:27,250
-Kosses.
-Osman Bey.

1053
01:49:27,460 --> 01:49:29,300
Return to your castle.

1054
01:49:29,710 --> 01:49:30,600
Brother.

1055
01:49:31,120 --> 01:49:33,300
Go to the tribe with Aygül.

1056
01:49:34,410 --> 01:49:36,370
The tribe is under your care.

1057
01:49:39,030 --> 01:49:39,860
Come on.

1058
01:49:42,740 --> 01:49:43,460
My bey.

1059
01:49:45,230 --> 01:49:46,110
My bey.

1060
01:49:47,020 --> 01:49:48,770
I couldn't say it but...

1061
01:49:49,350 --> 01:49:50,310
Bala Hatun...

1062
01:49:50,880 --> 01:49:53,730
she was giving birth.

1063
01:50:05,320 --> 01:50:07,020
My Allah, help us.

1064
01:50:08,720 --> 01:50:10,850
Help us, my Allah!

1065
01:50:36,210 --> 01:50:37,170
Mari.

1066
01:50:37,410 --> 01:50:40,630
The Vizier's soldiers are in the forest.
They are coming closer.

1067
01:50:40,660 --> 01:50:42,290
My Allah, help us.

1068
01:50:46,170 --> 01:50:47,770
What are you doing?
Wait.

1069
01:50:48,300 --> 01:50:49,740
I'm alright, mother.

1070
01:50:50,240 --> 01:50:51,560
No.

1071
01:50:51,700 --> 01:50:54,000
You need to gather your strenght.
Sit.

1072
01:50:56,060 --> 01:50:57,660
Malhun.
Give her Orhan.

1073
01:50:58,290 --> 01:50:59,820
Mother is right.

1074
01:51:03,530 --> 01:51:05,090
With the name of Allah.

1075
01:51:05,090 --> 01:51:06,950
Come on now.

1076
01:51:07,790 --> 01:51:09,610
Mother, be careful.

1077
01:51:34,200 --> 01:51:35,570
Alaca!

1078
01:51:39,710 --> 01:51:40,930
Alaca!

1079
01:51:47,400 --> 01:51:48,400
Alaca!

1080
01:51:50,780 --> 01:51:52,310
What are you doing here?

1081
01:52:04,160 --> 01:52:05,140
Bala?

1082
01:52:06,940 --> 01:52:07,850
Come on!

1083
01:52:24,850 --> 01:52:26,810
A stranger is approaching!

1084
01:52:45,970 --> 01:52:47,740
Where is Osman Bey?

1085
01:52:48,240 --> 01:52:50,140
What's the difference, Vizier Alemşah?

1086
01:52:50,420 --> 01:52:51,120
My bey?

1087
01:52:52,270 --> 01:52:53,370
Turgut Bey!

1088
01:52:56,670 --> 01:52:59,090
Aren't you going to behead us all?

1089
01:53:02,920 --> 01:53:11,210
I will. You, Osman, the beys
you gathered at the council...

1090
01:53:14,110 --> 01:53:16,790
I'll behead you all.

1091
01:53:16,880 --> 01:53:19,520
Would one revolt before giving up
on his life?

1092
01:53:22,010 --> 01:53:23,950
Now, listen to me well.

1093
01:53:26,010 --> 01:53:27,970
You will give our alps to me.

1094
01:53:29,190 --> 01:53:31,350
And I'll give you what you want.

1095
